  hints:
  - "Every skill learned so far is needed here. Scarlet and Dani must work in sequence before they can reunite."
  - "First, Scarlet must lift Dani onto the high ledge. Dani walks across and throws the lever to open the path. Then Scarlet faces a boulder and a plate that only the boulder can activate."
  - "Lift Dani onto the ledge and have her throw the lever. Scarlet walks through the opened gate and pushes the boulder north onto the stone plate. The final gate opens. Dani descends from the far end of the ledge. Both reach the glowing circle."
  skyColor: {r: 0.05, g: 0.05, b: 0.08, a: 1}
  orthographicSize: 8
